    "title": "Orca Screen Reader",
    "description": "Orca is a free, open source, extensible screen reader that provides access to the graphical desktop through speech and refreshable braille. It works with applications that provide accessibility information through the Assistive Technology Service Provider Interface (AT-SPI).",
